flowchart TD
  U[Authorized source] --> S[Immutable Source Snapshot]
  S --> Scan[Rights + Secret + Injection + Temporal scans]
  Scan --> X[Extraction Candidate]
  X --> Review[User Diff Review]
  Review --> Draft[DRAFT Tactic]
  Draft --> Canary[Simulation / Canary / Testing]
  Canary --> Stable[STABLE]
  S --> Rev[Revocation Order]
  Rev --> Impact[Derived Impact Graph]
  Impact --> Quarantine[Quarantine tactics and reverify tasks]
